    <description>Fires when AF_RequisitionStatus__c changes to Approved. Generates the Internal Requisition Form as a text file attached directly to the Opportunity (FirstPublishLocationId), emails the After Sales team using the configurable AF_ProcessEmailRouting__mdt.AfterSalesTeam address (skipped gracefully if that address has not yet been provided by the business - not an error), and confirms to the Opportunity Owner. KNOWN SIMPLIFICATION: the form is a plain-text summary, not a designed PDF template - true PDF rendering would need a Visualforce/Apex document generator, out of scope for this pass. 2026-09-09: Owner Confirmation email upgraded from plain text to branded HTML (sendRichBody=true). Tried real EmailTemplate (AF_ET_Opp_RequisitionApproved) + AF_SendTemplateEmailAction (Apex wrapper around Messaging.sendEmail(templateId=...)) first, since Flow&apos;s own &quot;emailTemplate&quot; core action is confirmed NOT a valid InvocableActionType in this org&apos;s Metadata API - but Messaging.sendEmail to a User target hard-requires saveAsActivity=false, and with that forced false, ZERO EmailMessage row is created (confirmed empirically: isSuccess()=true, no EmailMessage ever appears), unlike emailSimple+logEmailOnSend which reliably logs even to User recipients. Reverted to emailSimple/inline-HTML for this reason. The AfterSales email stays on emailSimple regardless - its recipient is a raw configured email address (AF_ProcessEmailRouting__mdt), not a User/Contact/Lead Id, so it was never a candidate for the emailTemplate/recipientId mechanism to begin with.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_AfterSalesSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Internal Requisition Form - &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_DocumentBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;INTERNAL REQUISITION FORM&quot; &amp; BR() &amp; BR() &amp;
&quot;Opportunity: &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; BR() &amp;
&quot;Requested Completion Date: &quot; &amp; TEXT({!$Record.AF_RequisitionCompletionDate__c}) &amp; BR() &amp; BR() &amp;
&quot;Approved by Sales Manager. Accessory/PDI specifications requiring action are flagged on the Opportunity&apos;s Line Items related list (AF_RequiresInternalRequisition__c) - see the linked Opportunity record for full detail.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_DocumentTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Internal Requisition Form - &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_FileName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Internal_Requisition_Form_&quot; &amp; {!$Record.Id} &amp; &quot;.txt&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_OwnerConfirmationBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#F4F4F6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E2E5EA;border-top:4px solid #1E7A46;padding:20px 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DFF3E6;color:#1E7A46;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Approved&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#0B2545;&quot;&gt;Internal Requisition Form Approved&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Your Internal Requisition Form request for &lt;strong&gt;&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &apos;&lt;/strong&gt; has been approved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;The form has been generated and attached to the Opportunity, and the After Sales team has been notified.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_OwnerConfirmationSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Approved: Internal Requisition Form for &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Your Internal Requisition Form request for &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot; was approved.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Requisition Approved: &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
